  "notes": "Whole Shrine of Remembrance exterior and integral raised forecourt/crypt-retaining drum, twin wrapping18-step staircases and central19-step flight, flanking sandstone retaining wings/coping/piers and two mapped reflecting pools. Open-sky circular18-column Doric colonnade, fluted shafts/capitals/abaci, ring entablature/triglyphs/rosettes and bronze crest, three-tier granite base/iron railings, simplified open-legged bronze urn/static flame and geometric floor. Exclude the wider park, other sculptural memorials, exact figured reliefs/names/text/offerings/people/trees, CentralStation and neighbouring offices, interiors/hidden gallery layout."
